  "description": "Automatic, consistent error handling for ASP.NET Core APIs with structured JSON responses, validation error details, custom JSON field names, YAML configuration, RFC 9457 Problem Details support, OpenTelemetry tracing, error message localization, rate limiting integration, and extensive configurability.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
